WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.670
The Shadow Organization is
an autonomous syndicate built around

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.600
those who are Specially-Talented
to exterminate the Ayakashi,

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.400
back when the power of darkness
was much stronger.

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:13.880
The special forces of
the Shadow Organization

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.240
call themselves the Night Troops.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:47.240
You don't look so happy,
Kasuga-san.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:50.910
Do you hate working for me that much?

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.970
It's not such a bad deal for you.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.840
Could you not be so casual
toward someone older than you?

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:02.180
You don't understand
the situation you're in, do you?

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:06.090
You've violated the taboo of
stepping into Karasumori.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.360
If I hadn't talked to the higher-ups,

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.960
your punishment would have been
much worse than house arrest.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:13.200
What higher-ups? It's already been
decided that you'll be joining them

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.360
as the youngest member
of the executive committee.

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:19.730
Impressive.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.340
Information reaches
your ears very fast.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.810
But that's what makes me
think highly of you.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:27.910
Think highly of me?
Don't give me that.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:31.320
You're the one that spurred me on
to go to Karasumori.

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:35.050
I don't remember actually
telling you to do it. Do you?

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:41.130
But then, I thought you would last longer
than one night after I told you about it.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.390
Well? What are you going to do?

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.630
Are you going to refuse my offer?

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:49.000
Even when I got this back for you?

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:50.400
Yoki!

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:03.220
I'll do it. I'm not stupid enough to
oppose the chief of the Night Troops.

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.460
I think I now understand why
the Hoin Mark didn't appear on you.

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:20.130
The preparations are complete.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:23.930
Was there a report?

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:24.830
Yes.

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:28.670
It seems that there is an organized effort
to take over Karasumori.

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:31.410
The investigations
are still ongoing,

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:34.580
so there is no need for you
to go there yourself, Chief.

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:38.680
Excuse me. I was being impudent
with that comment.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:49.870
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.730
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:56.940
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.840
(Fighting late into the night)

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:02.280
Drive away all hesitation

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:06.680
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:10.220
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:13.560
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:19.220
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:23.730
Sha la la la la...

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:30.140
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.110
(Secret romance)

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:37.310
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:39.080
(A strange distance)

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:45.920
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:46.990
Yeah

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:50.460
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:54.060
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:59.400
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:17.880
Looks like nothing
is appearing tonight.

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:19.590
You should be happy.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.550
Working like a dog every day
can't be healthy.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.120
You're a Demon Dog
and you still get tired?

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.530
I'm not a monster, you know!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:33.170
Look! My aim with the Nenshi
is getting better!

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:34.540
What are you saying?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.400
Ayakashi are moving targets.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:38.330
You still have lots to work on.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:43.080
Kekkai can have controlled coordinates
or controlled conditions designation.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:46.820
The Kekkai of controlled coordinates
cannot be moved.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:50.250
However. The Kekkai of
controlled conditions can be.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:58.380
What's this?!

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:01.960
Oh dear. Why are you sticking it
together like that?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.230
You're so stupid.

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:05.200
Why you... get off!

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:07.430
Stop it!
You'll hurt someone!

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:11.230
No way!

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:12.870
Hakubi! Pull yourself together!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.980
H-Honey, I love you...

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:19.280
Crap... my aim is too awesome...

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.110
Serves him right.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:22.310
Hey, Yoshimori!

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.480
How dare you do that
to my Hakubi!

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.120
I. Uh... It was an accident...

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:28.710
What is this?!

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:30.350
What do you mean?

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:34.020
I'm practicing the application
of Kekkai techniques... sort of.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:37.890
Application is for people
who've practiced the basics.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.870
You don't read the lesson scrolls
and just do whatever you want.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:40.990
That's why you always fail!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.400
Oh, shut up!

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.610
Quit talking about
those lesson scrolls!

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.630
I don't need them!

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:48.910
You just can't read them.

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:53.000
How can you be the Legitimate Heir and
not be able to read the lesson scrolls?

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.410
Looks like the Sumimura family line
ends with you.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.950
There's a lot more than I thought.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.050
Are all of these lesson scrolls?

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:09.930
Oh? This one looks really cocky.

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:11.790
I'll choose you then.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:15.600
Father. I'll do the rest later.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:17.640
No no, Shuji-san.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.370
Please let me do
at least this much...

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:20.330
Huh?

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:25.470
Y-You! What are you
doing to our tree?!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:30.850
Oh? The filthy tree next door to me
is dirtying up my home.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:32.410
That's why I had to cut it off!

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:36.820
You've done it now. This is unforgivable!
I'll show you!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:38.820
Prepare yourself!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.960
I'll just beat you down instead!

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:45.190
Eat my stark fist of justice!

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:46.830
You're carrying nothing but a broom,
you senile geezer!

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:49.230
- I finished my homework. I'm hungry.
- Laugh it up while you can!

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:50.770
- We'll have some snacks...
- I'll finish this once and for all!

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.040
- Once I finish cleaning up.
- Bring it on!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:52.710
Okay.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:55.880
I will show you the power of
the Legitimate Heir of the Hazama Style!

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:58.440
What?! How dare you call yourself
the Legitimate Heir!

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:05.180
"No squid... er...
Fishcake... sea urchin?"

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:08.650
What is this stuff?
Squid, fishcake, sea urchin?

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:10.390
I can't read it!

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:17.490
You're the Legitimate Heir and
you haven't even read the lesson scrolls?

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.400
No! At this rate
I'll get left behind!

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:24.400
Time to study the scrolls!

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.270
I'll use my secret sandwich plan!

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:32.680
Sandwich the indecipherable scrolls
between my favorite books

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.520
and I'll be able to read through it
while maintaining my concentration!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.150
Now then.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.810
Let's start off with
the "Sweets of the World."

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:44.920
You better give up while you can!

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.960
That's my line!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:49.590
You're wide open!

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.060
The door to the storehouse!

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.230
Yoshimori!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.940
You took things out of the storehouse
again without permission!

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:10.810
Divine retribution!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.750
Don't chop me out of nowhere!

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:14.020
Silence!

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:15.990
Stop chopping me over and over!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:17.250
No dinner for you!

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:19.060
Go and train in the dojo!

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:22.960
Really...

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.860
That ungrateful little fool...

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:28.540
But I'm sure Yoshimori
meant no harm.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:29.800
It doesn't matter.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.500
He drooled all over the scrolls
passed down by our ancestors!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:36.080
And of all things, he had to do it
to one of the book of secrets.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.770
Available only to
the Legitimate Heir!

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:40.770
Why is he acting so sneaky?

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.510
I wouldn't mind showing him
if he just asked.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.210
Those scrolls will be his one day.

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:52.020
If he were to just ask,
I would explain it to him.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.190
I suppose...

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:55.450
Thank you for the meal.

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:58.430
Oh, you're done?
Did you eat everything?

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:00.460
Yup. I'm full already.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.730
Toshimori, can you do me a favor?

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:08.270
I don't get it.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.740
"No squid... fishcake and urchin..."

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.780
Man, I'm hungry.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.810
Yoshi, here's your dinner.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:22.120
Dad wants you to eat this
while he's keeping Grandpa busy.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.150
Thanks.

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.220
Is that the book of secrets?

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:28.960
Yeah. You want to see it?

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:31.360
I can't seem to find anything worthwhile.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:34.760
All it talks about is food like squid,
fishcakes. And urchin.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.740
Squid and fishcake?

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:42.300
"No matter the circumstance.
You must maintain serenity..."

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.280
You can read it?

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:46.700
Huh? Uh...

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.780
Grandpa just taught me
a little about it.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:54.350
But isn't this something only
the Legitimate Heir can look at?

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:57.520
That doesn't matter.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.790
If you can read it,
you should be allowed to.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.190
And while you're at it,
take over this family duty for me.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.160
Toshimori...

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:10.900
I can read it a little. But I can't use
the techniques yet...

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.110
Th-That's not a problem!

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:16.470
Just practice a little and
you can use it right away!

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:19.270
When I was your age,
I really sucked at it!

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:22.580
But I don't have
the same talent as you.

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:28.350
I don't get him.

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:31.990
Why are all of my brothers
so distant?

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:34.190
Is it because we're
so far apart in age?

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:37.970
Anyway if it's talent
he's talking about

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.730
there's someone that's
much better than me...

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:46.660
You may not!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:50.570
The book of secrets belongs to Yoshimori
as he is the Legitimate Heir.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:54.870
No matter what reason you have
I cannot let you see them!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.040
But...

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.250
I understand how you feel.

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:01.690
A Caster of your caliber

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:04.420
would like to master all the secrets
the Hazama Style has to offer.

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:06.820
But this cannot be allowed.

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:11.320
Because the Hoin Mark appeared on him
Yoshimori is the Legitimate Heir.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:15.200
Please bear with it Masamori.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:19.740
I wish I didn't remember that.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:23.240
That's why I hate this
book of secrets. Lesson scrolls...

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:30.280
They've come...

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:38.880
What's wrong, Madarao?!

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:41.720
H-Honey, I can't take it anymore.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.890
W-What's going on?

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:45.860
I can't deal with the Ayakashi
this time around.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:48.400
You guys are going to have to
do it on your own.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.100
Is it that dangerous?

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:54.330
Yeah. It is.
This stink is killing me.

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:55.540
Wait. What?

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.240
Please let us sit out
for tonight's work.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.910
Don't give me that!
Hurry up and find it!

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.680
You're horrible!
Ogre! Demon!

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:06.780
Just find it!
I'll go and take it down for you!

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:09.480
Hakubi, you have to
go look for it too!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.250
Th-This is too heavy for me.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:15.690
Straighten up!
Yoshimori will get the jump on us!

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.930
S-Say, honey.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:20.660
Why don't we just leave
the stinky Ayakashi to them?

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.070
It's not a worthy opponent
for cool people like us.

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.070
What are you saying?!

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:28.030
A Kekkaishi can't just let
a Ayakashi run loose!

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:33.180
Oh, honey. You're so hardworking.
Almost too hardworking!

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:37.050
The enemy smells, right?
Then hurry up and find it!

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:39.850
It stinks everywhere,
and I can't pinpoint the location!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.520
Yoshimori! That! That!
Over there!

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:45.360
Oh please! Hurry up!

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:46.380
Leave it to me!

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.890
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:49.820
Metsu!

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.060
Doesn't seem like it's working.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:56.940
Then I'll do it again!
Hoi! Joso!

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.100
Ketsu!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:58.830
Metsu!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.870
Wow, it does stink up close.

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:10.810
I cast Metsu on it twice.
And it's not smashed up at all.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:15.920
Yoshimori, this is just a shell.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:16.820
Huh?

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:18.080
There's nothing inside.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:19.250
What does that mean?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.350
This Ayakashi can molt?

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:22.690
I don't know.

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:27.630
But considering how hard the shell is,
the actual enemy might be harder.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:34.970
No matter how hard it is.
I'll just cast Metsu on it some more times.

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.570
Maybe casting five times
would work.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:41.170
Five times?
That's going to be a bit of trouble.

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:43.910
Anyway, we better find out
where it is soon.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:47.820
It's going to be really bad if we let it
absorb any more of Karasumori's powers.

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:50.220
All right. Let's go, Madarao.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.420
What? I have to go too?

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.690
Hurry up and find it!
That's your job!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.460
- You're so cruel!
- Wait. Yoshimori!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.490
We have to think of a plan.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:58.630
Geez!

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:02.940
With the smell so bad. Hakubi and
Madarao won't be able to find it!

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:06.770
What are you going to do?
Searching blindly is a waste of time.

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:08.740
We can't use your nose,
but we still have our eyes and ears.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:10.940
Let me find a place with
a good view of the area!

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:12.710
But you better be careful.

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:15.050
It'll put us out in plain view too.

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.610
Finding it is the higher priority!

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:26.190
Kuro-Hime.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:42.370
Kuro-Hime, can you read
the waves for me?

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:46.210
Yes, the Ayakashi...
Its location.

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:49.510
Now then.
I wonder what it looks like.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:55.920
Can you see anything, Hakubi?

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:58.660
It smells... oh. It smells...

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:02.420
I'm sorry, but please keep trying!
Just don't get caught.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.960
Yeah, I'll keep trying.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.520
It's all for you, honey.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.500
I don't see anything.

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:15.470
What is this feeling?

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:20.740
It's as if I got thrown
into a different world.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.310
Is it the enemy?!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.120
Found it?

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:47.140
It looks like it'll be
a pain to deal with.

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:51.410
Let's see how you'll fight it,
Yoshimori.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.940
Joso! Ketsu! Metsu!

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:57.410
It's not moving.
Is it another shell?

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:58.580
Again?!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:01.320
Are we done yet? I want to go home
before my nose rots off!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.720
Stop whining! Let's go!

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:04.920
You're awful!

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:07.490
Bingo, honey.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:09.360
Let's go.
But we have to be careful.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.600
It's gone! It noticed us!

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:23.580
Honey, behind you!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:27.870
Ketsu!

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.620
Are you the Kekkaishi of this place?

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:32.620
That's right!

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:34.050
And I won't let you
run loose any longer!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.720
Don't make me laugh.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:41.460
Do you think you can fend off my scythe
with your puny Kekkai techniques?

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.060
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.360
It's no use!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:53.770
Who goes there?!

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:56.740
Hey you!
Now it's my turn!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:59.610
Oh? Here comes a second one.

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:02.720
You look like you'll
put up a better fight.

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:05.620
Don't disappoint me!

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:09.390
Come on! I'll eradicate
the source of this stench!

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.750
You sure talk big!

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:15.360
Come on!
Can't you do more than run away?

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:16.930
But I don't blame you.

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:23.830
Your puny little Kekkai
can't even scratch my armor!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:25.540
Hoi! Joso!

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:26.700
Ketsu!

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:28.730
Ketsu!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:29.970
Ketsu!

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.040
It cuts up my Kekkai
before I get a chance to cast Metsu!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:37.740
Yoshimori!

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:43.190
Well? Let's see you use that Kekkai
technique that you're so proud of now!

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:45.250
I'll cut off your arm
in an instant!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.960
Looks like you're too scared
to even speak, huh?

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.590
You stink! Get away from me!

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:52.690
What?!

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.800
You stink AND you're hard!

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:02.470
You got some rowdy feet there.
Are you really a Kekkaishi?

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:05.900
There aren't any rules when it
comes to exterminating Ayakashi!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.410
You little brat.

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:09.840
I went easy on you,
and now you're getting cocky on me!

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.240
Just you watch!

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.000
Oh shoot! It transformed!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:39.010
It stinks even more now!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.810
I can't take it anymore!
I'm gonna die!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:45.850
H-Hey! How am I supposed take down
something this big and hardened?

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:53.050
Tokine, I'll keep it busy.
You run to the other side!

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.760
Huh? Hey, Yoshimori!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.300
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.920
You brat...

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.900
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.040
Am I not focusing enough?

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.800
The walls of my Kekkai are too weak.

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:10.840
How about this?!

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:12.100
Metsu!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.350
He's even harder now
that he's transformed...

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.810
You just don't give up, do you?

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:23.220
When are you going to learn that
it's not going to work?

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:24.720
Ketsu!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.020
Damn it...

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:31.790
Oh? You still got some cheap tricks
up your sleeve.

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.820
But did you forget that
I have another scythe?

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:38.370
Yoshimori!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:39.460
Stay away, Tokine!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.170
This is it!

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:46.140
Nenshi?!
How many of them are there?!

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:52.070
He's...

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:57.480
Who are you?

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:00.290
I didn't hear anything about
there being a third one!

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:01.990
That's too bad for you.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.730
Right back at you!

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:09.090
If you'd stayed hidden,
you might have survived!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:10.400
Prepare yourself!

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.100
Metsu!

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:17.700
He cracked my scythe
with only one hit!

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:20.610
I see you're pretty sturdy.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:23.110
I'll take a more
effective approach next.

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:24.670
Why you!

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:26.850
Don't think you're all that
just because you cracked my scythe!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:27.780
Ketsu!

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:28.650
Metsu!

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:32.660
What was that?

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:37.530
It appeared for only a moment
but it looked like there were multiple Kekkai.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:43.260
That's impossible! This scythe is
the hardest part of my body!

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.030
There's no way you can
pulverize it so easily!

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:49.070
Apparently, this attack
is effective on you.

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:50.100
Uh-oh...

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:52.400
Then that settles it.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:54.510
Ketsu!

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.540
What is this?!

00:20:56.720 --> 00:21:00.410
Amazing! A five-layered Kekkai!
And it's big too!

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:03.690
What's going on?
I didn't hear anything about you!

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:05.290
Oh? From who?

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:08.450
I-I can't say...

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:09.820
I thought so.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:13.660
But you came here knowing that
this is how you might end up.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:16.060
Wait! Stop! Don't!!

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:17.870
It's a little too late for that.

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:18.760
Metsu!

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:22.400
Tenketsu!

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:27.040
That saved me!

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.380
Now I can finally breathe!

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:30.210
That stench was just unbelievable!

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:33.220
I never want to deal with such
a stinky enemy ever again!

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:35.780
Masamori-san, long time no see.

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:38.820
Hi. Tokine-chan.
You seem to be doing well!

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:40.860
Hey, Mas-san.
When did you get back?

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:41.820
Just now.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:43.860
Hey you,
what are you doing here?!

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:46.230
Oh right.
Let me introduce everyone.

00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:47.490
Come here.

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:53.560
It's so cute.

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:56.430
This is my partner, Kuro-Hime.
Please treat her well.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:58.640
I said, what are you doing here?!

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:02.840
Well, can you blame me for worrying
about my brother who does so poorly?

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:08.350
You haven't improved much over
the last three years have you Yoshimori?

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:14.090
How long will you
be staying this time?

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:15.990
I'll be here for a while.

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:18.420
Really? That's great!

00:22:18.470 --> 00:22:20.930
Mas-san, you should
stay here for good.

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:25.970
The guy I hate has come back...

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:45.890
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:52.590
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.170 --> 00:23:01.980
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:08.310
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:18.160
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:24.520
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:33.610
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:41.140
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:50.120
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:58.690
The red string connects one to another
